  Derivation chain:
    TOKENICODE (TinyZ, https://github.com/yiliqi78/TOKENICODE)
      -> TOKENICODE DeepSeek Alpha (https://github.com/mistydew/tokenicode-deepseek-alpha)
        -> this self-use build

  Modifications in this build include:
    - Session list follows the Claude CLI projects directory (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR aware),
      grouped by project, with live sync of changes made by the CLI
    - Remote connections over SSH (remote Windows hosts) with a local/remote mode switch
    - Model, thinking-effort and permission-mode options updated to match current Claude Code
    - Model-aware context window and auto-compact threshold
    - Taskbar overlay badge for finished sessions, minimize-to-taskbar on close
    - In-app updater disabled

